title: The Trade Unions
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and unions_timer <= 0
on-arrival: unions_timer = 3; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: movement

= The Trade Unions

[? if year <= 1920 : Millions of workers have poured into the Free Trade Unions since the war, and their leaders back Ebert. ?][? if year >= 1921 : The ADGB has eight million members, and its leaders expel communists who organise against them. ?] [? if ultraleft_gone = 0 : The Left Radicals say the old unions are dead and must be replaced by revolutionary workers' unions; others say the party must go where the workers are. ?][? if ultraleft_gone = 1 and kapd_exists = 1 : The KAPD and its General Workers' Union say the old unions must be smashed. Some of our own members agree. ?][? if ultraleft_gone = 1 and kapd_exists = 0 : The expelled Left Radicals say the old unions must be smashed. Some of those who stayed agree. ?]

- @inside: Work inside the existing unions.
- @fractions: Organise communist fractions in every union.
- @outside: Build revolutionary unions outside them.
- @easy_discard

@inside
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Wins workers and the USPD's respect; angers the radicals.
choose-if: lock_union_work < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids work inside the old unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_union_work == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 6;
Q.uspd_relation += 3;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 10;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 3;
if (!Q.ultraleft_gone) {
    Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 10;
}
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

Communists stand in union elections and speak at every branch meeting. It is slow, unglamorous work.

@fractions
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Disciplined communist groups inside the unions. The bureaucrats strike back.
view-if: year >= 1921
choose-if: lock_union_work < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids work inside the old unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_union_work == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.spd_relation -= 4;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 3;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 3;
if (Q.comintern_member) {
    Q.independence -= 2;
}
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Every communist in a union belongs to a fraction that meets before the branch meeting and votes as one, as the Red International of Labour Unions demands. Some branches fall to us. Some of our people are expelled.

@outside
subtitle: [? if ultraleft_gone = 0 : The Left Radicals' line. ?][? if ultraleft_gone = 1 : The Left's impatient wing approves. ?] Splits the workforce.
on-arrival: {!
Q.worker_support += 2;
Q.militancy += 4;
Q.unionist_satisfaction -= 10;
if (!Q.ultraleft_gone) {
    Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 10;
    Q.lean_ultraleft += 2;
} else {
    Q.offensive_satisfaction += 5;
    Q.kapd_relation += 4;
    Q.lean_offensive += 1;
}
!}

The new unions are small, militant and proud of it.
